---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

---
<figure class="fig11">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 290" role="img" aria-label="Two bars on one time axis. Without a timeout the slow call lasts 800 milliseconds. With a 0.25 second timeout, drawn in red, the call is cut at 250 milliseconds and the service answers 504. Below: the 99th percentile of the 200 responses falls from 817 to 68 milliseconds, and 10 of 400 calls became 504s.">
    <text x="40" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>The one slow call, with and without a deadline</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một lời gọi chậm, có và không có deadline</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="hourglass" x={50} y={86} size={24} />
    <text x="80" y="90" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>no timeout</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không timeout</tspan></text>
    <rect x="190" y="72" width="560" height="28" class="bar" />
    <text x="760" y="91" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>800 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>800 ms</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="stopwatch" x={50} y={166} size={24} />
    <text x="80" y="170" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>timeout 0.25 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>timeout 0.25 s</tspan></text>
    <rect x="190" y="152" width="175" height="28" class="rbar" />
    <rect x="365" y="152" width="4" height="28" class="rbar" />
    <text x="379" y="171" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>504 sent here</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trả 504 ở đây</tspan></text>
    <line x1="365" y1="60" x2="365" y2="200" class="rline" />
    <text x="371" y="52" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>0.25 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>0,25 s</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="240" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>p99 of the 200 answers: 817 ms before, 68 ms after.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>p99 của các response 200: 817 ms trước, 68 ms sau.</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="266" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>10 of 400 calls became a 504 instead of a slow 200. Counting those too, p99 is 263 ms.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>10 trong 400 lời gọi thành 504 thay vì một response 200 chậm. Tính cả chúng, p99 là 263 ms.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A timeout does not make the dependency faster. It decides how long you are willing to wait, and what the caller gets when you stop.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Timeout không làm dependency nhanh hơn. Nó quyết định bạn chịu chờ bao lâu, và người gọi nhận gì khi bạn thôi chờ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig11 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .fig11 .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .fig11 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .fig11 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .fig11 .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .fig11 .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .fig11 .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .fig11 .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .fig11 .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig11 .rbar { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .lead { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .fig11 .rline { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .fig11 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .rbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .fig11 .arrow { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .fig11 .arrow-l { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 .rarrow { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .rarrow-l { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
